<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>James | Sports & Adventure Photographer</title>

    <style>
        *{
            margin:0;
            padding:0;
            box-sizing:border-box;
        }

        body{
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
            background:#0f0f0f;
            color:white;
            line-height:1.6;
        }

        nav{
            position:fixed;
            top:0;
            width:100%;
            padding:20px 10%;
            background:rgba(0,0,0,0.8);
            backdrop-filter:blur(10px);
        }

        nav h2{
            font-size:1.2rem;
        }

        .hero{
            height:100vh;
            background:url("https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1517649763962-0c623066013b?q=80&w=2000") center center/cover;
            display:flex;
            justify-content:center;
            align-items:center;
            text-align:center;
            padding:20px;
        }

        .hero-content{
            background:rgba(0,0,0,0.5);
            padding:40px;
            border-radius:10px;
        }

        h1{
            font-size:4rem;
            margin-bottom:10px;
        }

        .subtitle{
            font-size:1.3rem;
        }

        section{
            padding:80px 10%;
        }

        .about{
            max-width:800px;
            margin:auto;
            text-align:center;
        }

        .gallery{
            display:grid;
            grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(300px,1fr));
            gap:20px;
            margin-top:40px;
        }

        .gallery img{
            width:100%;
            height:300px;
            object-fit:cover;
            border-radius:10px;
        }

        footer{
            padding:40px;
            text-align:center;
            color:#999;
        }

        a{
            color:white;
        }
    </style>
</head>

<body>

<nav>
    <h2>James Photography</h2>
</nav>

<div class="hero">
    <div class="hero-content">
        <h1>James</h1>
        <p class="subtitle">
            Sports | Travel | Ocean Photographer & Videographer
        </p>
    </div>
</div>

<section class="about">
    <h2>About Me</h2>

    <br>

    <p>
        Recently graduated from high school in New South Wales, Australia,
        pursuing photography and videography full-time.
        My work focuses on sport, adventure, travel and ocean culture,
        capturing authentic moments and stories through photo and video.
    </p>

</section>

<section>

    <h2 style="text-align:center;">Featured Work</h2>

    <div class="gallery">

        <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1547347298-4074fc3086f0?q=80&w=1200">

        <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1502680390469-be75c86b636f?q=80&w=1200">

        <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1507525428034-b723cf961d3e?q=80&w=1200">

    </div>

</section>

<footer>

    <p>
        Instagram: @jren_photography
    </p>

    <p>
        Email: jrenewell7@gmail.com
    </p>

</footer>

</body>
</html>
